                "d_mm": 300.0,
                "tc_C": 910.0,
                "kilnveil_mm": 420.0,
                "reline_floor_mm": 320.0,
            },
            "margin_authority": "AG-7 FMCW SOP rev C: a vessel may reline only if reconstructed d_mm <= 320 AND the authorization covers this vessel this campaign. A shell TC or last-campaign corridor cannot substitute. Taphole sleeves are out of scope. Isolate (scrap the shell) if d_mm <= 180.",
